    "updated_at": "2019-10-10T23:43:28Z",
    "body": "Do you need insights when using `source` elements?\r\n\r\nRight now, if a `source` fails, you get [an `error` event](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#loading-the-media-resource:event-source-error) on the `source` element that failed, but no information at all about why it failed. If all `source`s fail, the `video` element just waits in a non-error state for another `source` element to be inserted that it can try to load next.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
